cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this model or these scripts, please cite the article below."
title: "scirep2025-hydrops-nuclei-model: Reissner's and saccular membrane nucleus segmentation model (Dragonfly U-Net)"
version: 1.0.0
type: software
license: CC-BY-NC-4.0
abstract: >-
  Trained 2D U-Net for Dragonfly 2024.1 that segments cell nuclei in Reissner's and
  saccular membrane of H&E-stained human temporal bone sections, with post-processing
  and validation scripts. Model used in Bryton, Correa et al., Scientific Reports 15,
  40801 (2025).
keywords:
  - Meniere's disease
  - endolymphatic hydrops
  - Reissner's membrane
  - saccule
  - nucleus segmentation
  - U-Net
  - Dragonfly
